cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "creTarget: CRISPRi guide RNA design for the noncoding genome"
abstract: >-
  creTarget designs, scores, and ranks CRISPRi guide RNAs for noncoding
  target regions (SNPs and enhancers) in hg38. It combines FlashFry
  off-target and on-target scoring with optional CNN-based efficacy
  prediction, ATAC-seq accessibility annotation, and TSS-proximity
  screening, and scales from single targets to genome-wide libraries via
  Nextflow.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kazemi
    given-names: Mehrdad
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MikeKazz/creTarget"
url: "https://github.com/MikeKazz/creTarget"
keywords:
  - CRISPRi
  - guide RNA design
  - noncoding genome
  - enhancers
  - functional genomics
  - bioinformatics
references:
